WEBVTT

00:02:28.187 --> 00:02:31.575
millions that are qualified
for higher education,

00:02:31.599 --> 00:02:37.103
millions that want to study
yet cannot access it for various reasons.

00:02:37.618 --> 00:02:39.523
First: financial.

00:02:40.412 --> 00:02:43.307
Universities are expensive;
we all know it.

00:02:43.331 --> 00:02:45.435
In large parts of the world,

00:02:45.459 --> 00:02:49.346
higher education is unattainable
for an average citizen.

00:02:50.258 --> 00:02:54.102
This is probably the biggest problem
facing our society.

00:02:54.672 --> 00:02:58.258
Higher education stopped
being a right for all

00:02:58.282 --> 00:03:00.952
and became a privilege for the few.